  "steps": [
    "Words RHYME when they end with the same sound: cat, hat, bat!",
    "A word family is a group of words with the same ending — like the -at family: cat, hat, sat, mat.",
    "If you can read one word in the family, you can read them ALL — just change the first sound!",
    "Try the -an family: can, man, pan, ran. And the -ig family: big, pig, dig!"
  ],
